{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-01", "text": "太阳病，桂枝证，医反下之，利遂不止，脉促者，表未解也，喘而汗出者，葛根黄芩黄连汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "太阳病", "start": 0, "end": 3, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "利遂不止", "start": 13, "end": 17, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉促", "start": 18, "end": 20, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "喘", "start": 27, "end": 28, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "汗出", "start": 29, "end": 31, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "葛根黄芩黄连汤", "start": 33, "end": 40, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e5", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e6", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-02", "text": "伤寒，汗出解之后，胃中不和，心下痞硬，干噫食臭，胁下有水气，腹中雷鸣下利者，生姜泻心汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "伤寒", "start": 0, "end": 2, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "胃中不和", "start": 9, "end": 13, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "心下痞硬", "start": 14, "end": 18, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "干噫食臭", "start": 19, "end": 23, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "胁下有水气", "start": 24, "end": 29, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "腹中雷鸣下利", "start": 30, "end": 36, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e7", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "生姜泻心汤", "start": 38, "end": 43, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e5", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e6", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e7", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-03", "text": "下之后，复发汗，昼日烦躁不得眠，夜而安静，不呕，不渴，无表证，脉沉微，身无大热者，干姜附子汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "烦躁不得眠", "start": 10, "end": 15, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉沉微", "start": 31, "end": 34, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "干姜附子汤", "start": 41, "end": 46, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-04", "text": "伤寒表不解，心下有水气，干呕，发热而咳，或渴，或利，或噎，或小便不利、少腹满，或喘者，小青龙汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "伤寒", "start": 0, "end": 2, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "心下有水气", "start": 6, "end": 11, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "干呕", "start": 12, "end": 14, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "发热", "start": 15, "end": 17, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "咳", "start": 18, "end": 19, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "渴", "start": 21, "end": 22, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e7", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "利", "start": 24, "end": 25, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e8", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "噎", "start": 27, "end": 28, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e9", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "小便不利", "start": 30, "end": 34, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e10", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "少腹满", "start": 35, "end": 38, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e11", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "喘", "start": 40, "end": 41, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e12", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "小青龙汤", "start": 43, "end": 47, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e5", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e6", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e7", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e8", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e9", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e10", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e11", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e12", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-05", "text": "少阴病，下利清谷，里寒外热，手足厥逆，脉微欲绝，身反不恶寒，其人面色赤，或腹痛，或干呕，或咽痛，或利止脉不出者，通脉四逆汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "少阴病", "start": 0, "end": 3, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "下利清谷", "start": 4, "end": 8, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "里寒外热", "start": 9, "end": 13, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "手足厥逆", "start": 14, "end": 18, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉微欲绝", "start": 19, "end": 23, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "面色赤", "start": 32, "end": 35, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e7", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "腹痛", "start": 37, "end": 39, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e8", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "干呕", "start": 41, "end": 43, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e9", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "咽痛", "start": 45, "end": 47, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e10", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉不出", "start": 51, "end": 54, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e11", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "通脉四逆汤", "start": 56, "end": 61, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e5", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e6", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e7", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e8", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e9", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e10", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e11", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-06", "text": "太阳中风，下利，呕逆，表解者，乃可攻之。其人漐漐汗出，发作有时，头痛，心下痞硬满，引胁下痛，干呕短气，汗出不恶寒者，此表解里未和也，十枣汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "太阳中风", "start": 0, "end": 4, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "下利", "start": 5, "end": 7, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "呕逆", "start": 8, "end": 10, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "汗出", "start": 24, "end": 26, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "头痛", "start": 32, "end": 34, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "心下痞硬满", "start": 35, "end": 40, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e7", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "胁下痛", "start": 42, "end": 45, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e8", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "干呕", "start": 46, "end": 48, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e9", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "短气", "start": 48, "end": 50, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e10", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "十枣汤", "start": 66, "end": 69, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e5", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e6", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e7", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e8", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e9", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e10", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-07", "text": "小结胸病，正在心下，按之则痛，脉浮滑者，小陷胸汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYNDROME", "text": "小结胸病", "start": 0, "end": 4, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "按之则痛", "start": 10, "end": 14, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉浮滑", "start": 15, "end": 18, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "小陷胸汤", "start": 20, "end": 24, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [{"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e2", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_HAS_SYMPTOM", "head": "e1", "tail": "e3", "source": "manual"}, {"type": "SYNDROME_TO_FORMULA", "head": "e1", "tail": "e4", "source": "manual"}], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
{"id": "manual-20260324-b8-15-08", "text": "发汗后，身疼痛，脉沉迟者，桂枝加芍药生姜各一两人参三两新加汤主之。", "entities": [{"id": "e1", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "身疼痛", "start": 4, "end": 7, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "SYMPTOM", "text": "脉沉迟", "start": 8, "end": 11, "source": "manual"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "FORMULA", "text": "新加汤", "start": 27, "end": 30, "source": "manual"}], "relations": [], "meta": {"manual_override": true, "manual_override_batch": "2026-03-24-b8-15", "source": "human_manual_annotation", "label_tier": "gold_standard", "gold_source": "manual_review"}}
